{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-ledger-career-009-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/LedgerTests.cs", "line": 1531, "method": "BuildLedgerRelativePath_ReturnsCorrectPath", "category": "T3", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RecordingPaths.cs:104; reorder the Path.Combine args to (\"GameState\", \"Parsek\", \"ledger.pgld\") -> still green (contains-only asserts leave the composition unpinned); an exact-equality assert reds on any reorder", "what_it_asserts": "RecordingPaths.BuildLedgerRelativePath() returns a path containing Parsek, GameState and ledger.pgld.", "why_weak": "The three Assert.Contains calls pin component presence, not composition; a reordered or nested path passes. The sibling path cell ResourceBudgetTests.BuildMilestonesRelativePath_CorrectPath (line 645) already asserts exact equality, so the stronger form is established in-repo and trivially feasible.", "proposed_action": "Replace the three Assert.Contains calls with Assert.Equal(Path.Combine(\"Parsek\", \"GameState\", \"ledger.pgld\"), RecordingPaths.BuildLedgerRelativePath()).", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "Ledger", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/GameActions/Ledger.cs", "sut_line": 683, "case_kind": "negative", "proposed_name": "LoadFromFile_WrongSchemaGeneration_IsRejected", "sketch": "Save a ledger with Ledger.SaveToFile, rewrite the recordingSchemaGeneration value to CurrentRecordingSchemaGeneration+1, call Ledger.ResetForTesting, then assert LoadFromFile returns false, Actions is empty, and the log carries 'unsupported schema' plus expectedGeneration=.", "guards": "The generation half of the LoadFromFile schema gate (Ledger.cs:683-698). LoadFromFile_BadVersion_LogsWarning pins only the version half, so a change making generationOk unconditionally true ships green and a future-generation ledger loads as if compatible.", "risk": "career"}
{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "Ledger", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/GameActions/Ledger.cs", "sut_line": 929, "case_kind": "state-transition", "proposed_name": "Reconcile_PrunedRows_InvalidateTheElsCache", "sketch": "Add two untagged ScienceSpending rows at UT 20000; take EffectiveState.ComputeELS().Count == 2 to populate the cache; Reconcile(new HashSet<string>(), maxUT: 18000.0) prunes both; assert Ledger.StateVersion moved and ComputeELS().Count is 0, not the cached 2.", "guards": "The StateVersion bump on Reconcile's prune path (Ledger.cs:928-929). EffectiveState.ComputeELS caches against Ledger.StateVersion (EffectiveState.cs:1463-1470); the sibling cells pin only TruncateActionsForTesting and the funds seed repair, so deleting this bump would leave a stale ELS serving pruned rows.", "risk": "career"}
